→ answer: For the Instant Advance, no: "Albert will not engage in any debt collection activities if your Instant advance is not repaid on the scheduled date." Not repaying can still affect your access, since Albert may deny you access to Albert Instant if you "do not repay the full balance of your Instant Advance." The Instant line of credit has different terms, where "late fees may apply and you may be suspended from accessing additional draws on your line of credit," and the sources I have don't say how unpaid balances on it are handled, so support can help in the app if that's your product.

